cff-version: 1.2.0
title: tcrsmalldist
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: May
    given-names: Damon
abstract: >-
  A calibrated same-peptide probability for TCR pairs that TCRdist calls close. For a pair of
  beta-chain CDR3s separated by one indel and/or one or two amino-acid substitutions, the model
  returns the probability that the two receptors bind the same peptide.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/dhmay/tcrsmalldist
# version and date-released are set at each release
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-13

